    "/code-modification/request": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Code Modification"
        ],
        "summary": "Request code modification for vulnerability fix",
        "description": "Submit a code modification request to fix a vulnerability in a Python requirements.txt file.\nThe request is saved to .code-requests/pending/ and automatically processed by the AI CLI.\n\n⚠️ IMPORTANT — how to fill in this request correctly:\n\n• `vulnerability_info.affected_files`: list ONLY the requirements.txt paths\n  (e.g. [\"auth-service/requirements.txt\", \"risk-service/requirements.txt\"]).\n  Do NOT include pom.xml or other non-Python files.\n\n• `modification_request.fix_packages`: the most important field — list every\n  package that needs upgrading in 'package>=version' format:\n    [\"urllib3>=2.6.3\", \"PyJWT>=2.12.0\", \"lxml>=6.1.0\"]\n  Black Duck reads the minimum version number, so the number must be changed\n  even when the constraint is '>=' (e.g. '>=2.3.0' is still flagged as 2.3.0).\n\n• `modification_request.details`: a human-readable summary that also repeats\n  the package versions in 'package>=version' format for reference.\n\nExample JSON body:\n```json\n{\n  \"source\": \"orchestrate\",\n  \"type\": \"vulnerability_fix\",\n  \"vulnerability_info\": {\n    \"project_name\": \"wyattlu-source/sentinel-flow-demo\",\n    \"version\": \"main\",\n    \"severity\": \"HIGH\",\n    \"vulnerability_type\": \"dependency_vulnerability\",\n    \"affected_files\": [\n      \"auth-service/requirements.txt\",\n      \"risk-service/requirements.txt\",\n      \"transaction-service/requirements.txt\",\n      \"api-gateway/requirements.txt\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"urllib3 < 2.6.3 has CVE-XXXX. PyJWT < 2.12.0 is vulnerable.\"\n  },\n  \"modification_request\": {\n    \"action\": \"upgrade_dependency\",\n    \"details\": \"Upgrade urllib3>=2.6.3; PyJWT>=2.12.0; lxml>=6.1.0 in all requirements.txt files.\",\n    \"fix_packages\": [\"urllib3>=2.6.3\", \"PyJWT>=2.12.0\", \"lxml>=6.1.0\"],\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWorkflow:\n1. Orchestrate sends this request\n2. Request saved to .code-requests/pending/\n3. claude_auto_fix.py detects it and calls the AI CLI automatically\n4. AI reads each requirements.txt and replaces the version numbers\n5. Status updated to completed",
        "operationId": "requestCodeModification",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CodeModificationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CodeModificationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "x-ibm-nl-intent-examples": [
          "fix the vulnerability in my code by upgrading the dependency",
          "upgrade urllib3 to fix the vulnerability",
          "修復程式碼中的漏洞，升級依賴套件版本",
          "幫我升級 requirements.txt 中的套件版本",
          "自動修復安全問題，修改 requirements.txt",
          "請修改程式碼來解決漏洞，使用 fix_packages 欄位列出每個套件的目標版本",
          "fix security issues by updating package versions in requirements.txt",
          "modify requirements.txt to upgrade vulnerable dependencies"
        ]
      }
    },
